<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Franchise Finance raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Franchise Finance raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it upgraded Franchise Finance Corp of America to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Franchise Finance gained 3/8 to 24-1/8.</p>
</text>
